<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib19.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">The Thirteenth International Conference on Learning Representations</em>, 2025.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">URL <a href="https://openreview.net/forum?id=VNckp7JEHn" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://openreview.net/forum?id=VNckp7JEHn</a>.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib20" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Xue et al. (2023)</span>
