</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Dynamic voting for efficient reasoning in large language models.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In Houda Bouamor, Juan Pino, and Kalika Bali (eds.), <em id="bib.bib20.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2023</em>, pp.  3085–3104, Singapore, December 2023. Association for Computational Linguistics.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><a href="https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2023.findings-emnlp.203" title="" class="ltx_ref">10.18653/v1/2023.findings-emnlp.203</a>.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">URL <a href="https://aclanthology.org/2023.findings-emnlp.203/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://aclanthology.org/2023.findings-emnlp.203/</a>.

</span></li>
      
